# Environment variables
.env
arcane_dump/
wpak/

# Generated asset exports - regenerate with tools/, never commit (multi-GB)
# The bundles are excluded by their *contents* rather than as a directory, because git
# cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded -- and the consumer guide
# is worth tracking. It is prose, not a generated bundle: it is the entry point a fresh
# integration starts from, and it is useless to anyone who does not have this checkout.
export_aegisfall/*
!export_aegisfall/README.md
export_gltf/
export_icons/
export_textures/
export_atlas/
# One-creature verification exports written by pose/rest checks
.resttest/
.wingtest/
